## The capability
STC-001 reads a body's state. STC-002 addresses it. This chip DETECTS when a
planet's state CHANGES and BLUEPRINTS the change: it sweeps the filed clock
across the planet's whole trajectory and emits the ordered ledger of its
state transitions — every epoch where the planet's address crosses a filed
band edge, and every roster closing the planet lives through. The ledger is
the blueprint; the count of transitions is the planet's pulse.

